==Battleground==
*1 [[Large White Ball]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] (400%) spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Large White Ball]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] (400%) spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Large Red Ball]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Large Red Ball]]s (400%) spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**9 [[Large White Ball]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
These balls might seem dangerous, but they're easily taken out in droves by Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|The Flying Cat]].

